  "text": "Business Performance | IR | Neural Group Inc. Top Company M&A Technology IR Careers Contact Top - IR - Business Performance I R Business Performance TRANSITION OF BUSINESS PERFORMANCE Net Sales (Millions of Yen) Operating Profit (Millions of Yen) Ordinary Profit (Millions of Yen) Net Income Attributable to Owners of Parent (Millions of Yen) Net Income per Share (Yen) We have shifted to consolidated accounting from the end of the fiscal year ended December 2021. In the above, in order to show the transition of performance, non-consolidated figures are shown up to the third quarter of the fiscal year ended December 2021. Since our company was established on January 22, 2018, the first fiscal period is the 11 months and 10 days from January 22, 2018 to December 31, 2018. Our company implemented a stock split of 1,000 shares for each common share as of April 15, 2020. The above shows the transition of per-share indicators when retroactive adjustments are made to account for the impact of this stock split. Notes on use - If corrections to financial results summaries, etc. are announced, the contents of this data will not be reflected immediately. - For some indicators, they may be updated only for the full year due to changes in the format of the financial results summary. Business Performance Financial Position Cash Flow Status Investor Information Tokyo Midtown Hibiya, Hibiya Mitsui Tower 32F 1-1-2 Yurakucho, Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo 100-0006 Privacy Policy Security Policy © Neural Group Inc. All Rights Reserved.",
